    "custom_liquid_eEd6jY": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "Custom HTML/Liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "{% comment %}\n  ============================================================================\n  Elite Sim Golf — Track Your Order page\n  ----------------------------------------------------------------------------\n  HOW TO INSTALL\n  1. Shopify Admin → Online Store → Pages → Add page\n     - Title: \"Track Your Order\"\n     - Content: leave blank (this template renders everything)\n     - Theme template: create + assign a new template \"page.track-order\"\n  2. Online Store → Themes → Edit code → Templates → Add a new template\n     - Type: Page, Name: track-order  → creates templates/page.track-order.liquid\n  3. Paste this entire file into templates/page.track-order.liquid\n  4. Save, then open the page from Online Store → Pages and confirm the\n     \"Track Your Order\" template is selected in the page's Theme template dropdown.\n  5. Add \"Track Order\" to your header/footer menu, linking to /pages/track-your-order\n     (or whatever handle you gave the page).\n  6. SEO: on the same page in Shopify Admin, scroll to \"Search engine listing\"\n     and click Edit website SEO, then set:\n       Page title:       Track Your Order | Elite Sim Golf\n       Meta description: Track your Elite Sim Golf order in seconds. Enter your\n                          order number and email to get real-time shipping status,\n                          carrier tracking, and delivery estimates.\n     (Title ~40 characters, description ~155 characters — both within Google's\n     display limits and written to match what a customer would actually search:\n     \"track my elite sim golf order\" / \"where is my order\".)\n\n  WHY THIS WORKS THE WAY IT DOES\n  ESG uses ParcelPanel (CWILL) for live carrier tracking, installed at the\n  default Shopify app proxy route /apps/parcelpanel. This page is a custom-\n  styled front door to that same tracking data — it collects Order # + Email,\n  builds the ParcelPanel lookup URL client-side, and redirects straight to\n  the live tracking page. No Shopify account login or one-time code is\n  required, since ParcelPanel handles the order+email verification itself.\n\n  ParcelPanel token format (must match exactly or the lookup will fail):\n    token = reverse(email), then replace \"@\" with \"_-_\" (underscore-hyphen-\n    underscore, NOT a bare hyphen — verified against a real ParcelPanel\n    tracking link from this store's Shopify app proxy).\n    e.g. admin@allseasonsgolfclub.com\n         reversed: moc.bulcflogsnosaesslla@nimda\n         token:    moc.bulcflogsnosaesslla_-_nimda\n\n  This page is built to:\n    - Look and feel like a native ESG order-lookup form\n    - Collect Order # + Email from the customer (for your own UX/analytics)\n    - Route the customer straight to ParcelPanel's live tracking page at\n      /apps/parcelpanel?order={order}&token={reversed_email}\n    - Give a fast path back to the confirmation email + direct carrier\n      tracking number entry, since that's the #1 reason people bounce\n      off tracker pages\n    - Keep a separate \"Sign in to your account\" path (routes.account_login_url)\n      for customers who want full order history, not just live tracking\n  ============================================================================\n{% endcomment %}\n\n<div class=\"esg-track-page\" id=\"esg-track-page\">\n  <div class=\"esg-track-container\">\n\n    <!-- ============ HERO / INTRO ============ -->\n    <section class=\"esg-track-hero\">\n      <p class=\"esg-eyebrow\">Order Support</p>\n      <h1 class=\"esg-track-title\">Track Your Order</h1>\n      <p class=\"esg-track-sub\">\n        Enter your order number and the email you checked out with. We'll take you straight\n        to your secure order status &mdash; shipping updates, tracking numbers, and delivery estimates,\n        all in one place.\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ============ LOOKUP CARD ============ -->\n    <section class=\"esg-track-card\" aria-labelledby=\"esg-lookup-heading\">\n      <h2 id=\"esg-lookup-heading\" class=\"esg-card-title\">Look up your order</h2>\n\n      <form id=\"esg-order-lookup-form\" class=\"esg-lookup-form\" novalidate>\n        <div class=\"esg-field\">\n          <label for=\"esg-order-number\">Order number</label>\n          <input\n            type=\"text\"\n            id=\"esg-order-number\"\n            name=\"order_number\"\n            placeholder=\"e.g. #10456\"\n            autocomplete=\"off\"\n            inputmode=\"text\"\n            required\n          />\n          <span class=\"esg-field-hint\">Found in your confirmation email subject line.</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <div class=\"esg-field\">\n          <label for=\"esg-order-email\">Email address</label>\n          <input\n            type=\"email\"\n            id=\"esg-order-email\"\n            name=\"email\"\n            placeholder=\"you@example.com\"\n            autocomplete=\"email\"\n            required\n          />\n          <span class=\"esg-field-hint\">The email used at checkout.</span>\n        </div>\n\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"esg-btn-primary\" id=\"esg-lookup-submit\">\n          <span>Track My Order</span>\n          <svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <line x1=\"5\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"19\" y2=\"12\"></line>\n            <polyline points=\"12 5 19 12 12 19\"></polyline>\n          </svg>\n        </button>\n\n        <p class=\"esg-form-note\" id=\"esg-form-error\" role=\"alert\" hidden>\n          Please enter both your order number and email address.\n        </p>\n\n        <p class=\"esg-form-fallback\" id=\"esg-form-fallback\" role=\"status\" hidden>\n          Taking a while? Your browser may be blocking the tracking page.\n          <a href=\"/apps/parcelpanel\">Click here to continue manually &rarr;</a>\n        </p>\n      </form>\n\n      <p class=\"esg-secure-note\">\n        <svg width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <rect x=\"3\" y=\"11\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" rx=\"2\"></rect>\n          <path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path>\n        </svg>\n        You'll be taken straight to your live shipment status — no account or password needed.\n      </p>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ============ ALTERNATE PATHS ============ -->\n    <section class=\"esg-track-alt\">\n      <div class=\"esg-alt-card\">\n        <div class=\"esg-alt-icon\">\n          <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2Z\"></path>\n            <path d=\"m22 6-10 7L2 6\"></path>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>Check your inbox</h3>\n        <p>Every order confirmation and shipping update includes a direct \"Track Order\" link &mdash; the fastest way to see live status.</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"esg-alt-card\">\n        <div class=\"esg-alt-icon\">\n          <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle>\n            <path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>Have a tracking number?</h3>\n        <p>Enter it directly with the carrier for real-time scan history and delivery windows.</p>\n        <div class=\"esg-carrier-links\">\n          <a href=\"https://www.fedex.com/fedextrack/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">FedEx</a>\n          <a href=\"https://www.ups.com/track\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">UPS</a>\n          <a href=\"https://tools.usps.com/go/TrackConfirmAction\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">USPS</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"esg-alt-card\">\n        <div class=\"esg-alt-icon\">\n          <svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.75\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n            <path d=\"M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path>\n            <circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle>\n          </svg>\n        </div>\n        <h3>Sign in to your account</h3>\n        <p>See your full order history, past receipts, and warranty registrations in one dashboard.</p>\n        <a href=\"{{ routes.account_login_url }}\" class=\"esg-alt-link\">Go to My Account &rarr;</a>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ============ FAQ ============ -->\n    <section class=\"esg-track-faq\">\n      <h2 class=\"esg-card-title\">Shipping &amp; Tracking FAQ</h2>\n\n      <div class=\"esg-faq-item\">\n        <button class=\"esg-faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n          <span>When will I get my tracking number?</span>\n          <svg class=\"esg-faq-chevron\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"esg-faq-a\">\n          <p>Most in-stock items ship within 1&ndash;3 business days. You'll receive an automated email with your tracking number as soon as your order leaves our warehouse. Made-to-order items (like custom enclosures and impact screens) ship per the lead time listed on the product page.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"esg-faq-item\">\n        <button class=\"esg-faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n          <span>My order shows \"processing\" &mdash; is that normal?</span>\n          <svg class=\"esg-faq-chevron\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"esg-faq-a\">\n          <p>Yes. Large freight items (enclosures, screens, simulator packages) are quality-checked and palletized before handoff to the carrier, which can take a few extra days beyond standard parcel orders.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"esg-faq-item\">\n        <button class=\"esg-faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n          <span>My tracking link says \"no information available\"</span>\n          <svg class=\"esg-faq-chevron\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"esg-faq-a\">\n          <p>Carriers can take 24&ndash;48 hours to scan a package after label creation. If it's been longer than that with no movement, reach out and we'll investigate with the carrier directly.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"esg-faq-item\">\n        <button class=\"esg-faq-q\" aria-expanded=\"false\">\n          <span>Can I change my shipping address after ordering?</span>\n          <svg class=\"esg-faq-chevron\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><polyline points=\"6 9 12 15 18 9\"></polyline></svg>\n        </button>\n        <div class=\"esg-faq-a\">\n          <p>If your order hasn't shipped yet, contact us right away and we'll update it. Once freight is scheduled, address changes may incur a carrier reroute fee.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- ============ CONTACT BAND ============ -->\n    <section class=\"esg-track-contact\">\n      <div class=\"esg-contact-inner\">\n        <div>\n          <h3>Still need help?</h3>\n          <p>Our support team can look up any order directly.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"esg-contact-actions\">\n          <a href=\"tel:8656571028\" class=\"esg-btn-outline\">865-657-1028</a>\n          <a href=\"/pages/contact\" class=\"esg-btn-primary-alt\">Contact Support</a>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </section>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  #esg-track-page {\n    --esg-navy: #0a1a3a;\n    --esg-navy-2: #0f2450;\n    --esg-bg: #f8f8f8;\n    --esg-white: #ffffff;\n    --esg-border: #e2e4ea;\n    --esg-text: #1a1f2b;\n    --esg-text-muted: #5a6072;\n    font-family: 'Barlow Condensed', 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;\n    background: var(--esg-bg);\n    color: var(--esg-text);\n    padding-block: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 4rem);\n  }\n\n  #esg-track-page * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\n  .esg-track-container {\n    max-width: 1200px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding-inline: clamp(1rem, 4vw, 2rem);\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4rem);\n  }\n\n  /* Hero */\n  .esg-track-hero { text-align: center; max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  .esg-eyebrow {\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n    font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 0.9rem + 0.2vw, 1.05rem);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--esg-navy);\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n  }\n  .esg-track-title {\n    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 1.8rem + 2.6vw, 3.4rem);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--esg-navy);\n    line-height: 1.1;\n    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;\n    letter-spacing: -0.01em;\n  }\n  .esg-track-sub {\n    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 1.15rem + 0.35vw, 1.4rem);\n    color: var(--esg-text-muted);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n\n  /* Lookup card */\n  .esg-track-card {\n    background: var(--esg-white);\n    border: 1px solid var(--esg-border);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);\n    width: 100%;\n    box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(10, 26, 58, 0.06);\n  }\n  .esg-card-title {\n    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 1.4rem + 0.6vw, 1.85rem);\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--esg-navy);\n    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n  .esg-lookup-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; }\n  .esg-field { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.375rem; }\n  .esg-field label {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--esg-navy);\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n  }\n  .esg-field input {\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n    border: 1px solid var(--esg-border);\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    background: var(--esg-bg);\n    color: var(--esg-text);\n    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;\n  }\n  .esg-field input:focus {\n    outline: none;\n    border-color: var(--esg-navy);\n    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(10, 26, 58, 0.1);\n  }\n  .esg-field-hint { font-size: 1.025rem; color: var(--esg-text-muted); }\n\n  .esg-btn-primary {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n    background: var(--esg-navy);\n    color: var(--esg-white);\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-transform: uppercase;\n    letter-spacing: 0.04em;\n    padding: 0.9rem 1.5rem;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    border: none;\n    cursor: pointer;\n    transition: background 0.15s ease, transform 0.1s ease;\n    text-decoration: none;\n  }\n  .esg-btn-primary:hover { background: var(--esg-navy-2); }\n  .esg-btn-primary:active { transform: translateY(1px); }\n  .esg-btn-primary svg { transition: transform 0.15s ease; }\n  .esg-btn-primary:hover svg { transform: translateX(3px); }\n\n  .esg-form-note {\n    color: #a12c2c;\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n    text-align: center;\n  }\n\n  .esg-form-fallback {\n    background: rgba(10, 26, 58, 0.06);\n    border: 1px solid rgba(10, 26, 58, 0.2);\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    padding: 0.75rem 1rem;\n    font-size: 1.05rem;\n    color: var(--esg-text);\n    text-align: center;\n    line-height: 1.5;\n  }\n  .esg-form-fallback a {\n    display: block;\n    margin-top: 0.35rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--esg-navy);\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-underline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n\n  .esg-secure-note {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    gap: 0.4rem;\n    font-size: 1rem;\n    color: var(--esg-text-muted);\n    margin-top: 1.25rem;\n  }\n\n  /* Alt paths */\n  .esg-track-alt {\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);\n    gap: 1.25rem;\n  }\n  .esg-alt-card {\n    background: var(--esg-white);\n    border: 1px solid var(--esg-border);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: 1.75rem;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    gap: 0.5rem;\n  }\n  .esg-alt-icon {\n    width: 44px;\n    height: 44px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: rgba(10, 26, 58, 0.06);\n    color: var(--esg-navy);\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: center;\n    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n  }\n  .esg-alt-card h3 {\n    font-size: 1.4rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--esg-navy);\n  }\n  .esg-alt-card p {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    color: var(--esg-text-muted);\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n  .esg-carrier-links {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 0.75rem;\n    margin-top: 0.5rem;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n  }\n  .esg-carrier-links a {\n    font-size: 1.075rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--esg-navy);\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-underline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n  .esg-alt-link {\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: var(--esg-navy);\n    text-decoration: none;\n    margin-top: 0.5rem;\n  }\n  .esg-alt-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n\n  /* FAQ */\n  .esg-track-faq { width: 100%; }\n  .esg-faq-item {\n    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--esg-border);\n  }\n  .esg-faq-q {\n    width: 100%;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    gap: 1rem;\n    background: none;\n    border: none;\n    padding: 1.1rem 0;\n    font-family: inherit;\n    font-size: 1.25rem;\n    font-weight: 600;\n    color: var(--esg-navy);\n    cursor: pointer;\n    text-align: left;\n  }\n  .esg-faq-chevron { transition: transform 0.2s ease; flex-shrink: 0; }\n  .esg-faq-q[aria-expanded=\"true\"] .esg-faq-chevron { transform: rotate(180deg); }\n  .esg-faq-a {\n    max-height: 0;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    transition: max-height 0.25s ease;\n  }\n  .esg-faq-a p {\n    padding-bottom: 1.1rem;\n    font-size: 1.15rem;\n    color: var(--esg-text-muted);\n    line-height: 1.6;\n  }\n\n  /* Contact band */\n  .esg-track-contact {\n    background: var(--esg-navy);\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    padding: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 2.25rem);\n  }\n  .esg-contact-inner {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    flex-wrap: wrap;\n    gap: 1.5rem;\n  }\n  .esg-contact-inner h3 {\n    color: var(--esg-white);\n    font-size: 1.6rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n  }\n  .esg-contact-inner p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7); font-size: 1.15rem; }\n  .esg-contact-actions { display: flex; gap: 0.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }\n  .esg-btn-outline {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;\n    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.4);\n    color: var(--esg-white);\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    transition: border-color 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;\n  }\n  .esg-btn-outline:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-color: var(--esg-white); }\n  .esg-btn-primary-alt {\n    display: inline-flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    padding: 0.75rem 1.25rem;\n    background: var(--esg-white);\n    color: var(--esg-navy);\n    font-size: 1.1rem;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    border-radius: 3px;\n    transition: filter 0.15s ease;\n  }\n  .esg-btn-primary-alt:hover { filter: brightness(0.95); }\n\n  /* Responsive */\n  @media (max-width: 860px) {\n    .esg-track-alt { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 640px) {\n    .esg-contact-inner { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }\n    .esg-track-title { font-size: 2rem; }\n  }\n</style>\n\n<script>\n  (function () {\n    var form = document.getElementById('esg-order-lookup-form');\n    var errorEl = document.getElementById('esg-form-error');\n    if (!form) return;\n\n    var fallbackEl = document.getElementById('esg-form-fallback');\n\n    form.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {\n      e.preventDefault();\n      var orderNumber = document.getElementById('esg-order-number').value.trim();\n      var email = document.getElementById('esg-order-email').value.trim();\n\n      if (!orderNumber || !email) {\n        errorEl.hidden = false;\n        return;\n      }\n      errorEl.hidden = true;\n\n      // Hand the customer straight to ParcelPanel's live tracking page,\n      // pre-filled with their order number and a token built from their\n      // email. ParcelPanel's token format is: reverse the full email string,\n      // then swap \"@\" for \"_-_\" (verified against a real ParcelPanel link).\n      // This matches the token ParcelPanel itself generates on tracking\n      // links in shipping confirmation emails.\n      function buildParcelPanelToken(rawEmail) {\n        return rawEmail.split('').reverse().join('').replace('@', '_-_');\n      }\n\n      var cleanOrderNumber = orderNumber.replace(/^#/, '');\n      var token = buildParcelPanelToken(email);\n      var target = '/apps/parcelpanel?order=' + encodeURIComponent(cleanOrderNumber) +\n        '&token=' + encodeURIComponent(token);\n\n      // ParcelPanel's tracking page is served via Shopify's app proxy on our\n      // own domain, so it isn't affected by the account.* browser-extension\n      // blocking issue. Fallback link kept as a safety net in case of any\n      // navigation hiccup.\n      var navigated = false;\n      window.addEventListener('pagehide', function () { navigated = true; });\n      setTimeout(function () {\n        if (!navigated && fallbackEl) {\n          fallbackEl.hidden = false;\n          fallbackEl.querySelector('a').href = target;\n        }\n      }, 2500);\n\n      window.location.href = target;\n    });\n\n    // FAQ accordion\n    document.querySelectorAll('.esg-faq-q').forEach(function (btn) {\n      btn.addEventListener('click', function () {\n        var expanded = btn.getAttribute('aria-expanded') === 'true';\n        var answer = btn.nextElementSibling;\n        btn.setAttribute('aria-expanded', String(!expanded));\n        if (expanded) {\n          answer.style.maxHeight = null;\n        } else {\n          answer.style.maxHeight = answer.scrollHeight + 'px';\n        }\n      });\n    });\n  })();\n</script>\n\n{% comment %} SEO: FAQPage schema {% endcomment %}\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"When will I get my tracking number?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Most in-stock items ship within 1-3 business days. You'll receive an automated email with your tracking number as soon as your order leaves our warehouse. Made-to-order items ship per the lead time listed on the product page.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"My order shows processing, is that normal?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Large freight items like enclosures and screens are quality-checked and palletized before handoff to the carrier, which can take a few extra days beyond standard parcel orders.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"My tracking link says no information available\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Carriers can take 24-48 hours to scan a package after label creation. If it has been longer than that with no movement, contact support and we will investigate with the carrier directly.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I change my shipping address after ordering?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"If your order has not shipped yet, contact us right away and we will update it. Once freight is scheduled, address changes may incur a carrier reroute fee.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>",
